# BuildKit uses this in preference to the repo-root .dockerignore for `trigger-api/Dockerfile`.
# Context is the repo root (pnpm workspace), so keep the pnpm members (shared, pwa, trigger-api) +
# the lockfile/workspace manifest; drop everything heavy or unrelated to this image.
**/node_modules
**/.venv
**/__pycache__
**/dist
**/.terraform
**/*.tfstate*
.git
.github
minion
infra
functions
specs
docs
